    "detailed_description": "<strong>DEMO IS OUT NOW!! Attention, the Demo is Singleplayer, but the final game is still planned to be Online Coop!</strong><br><br><strong>This DEMO has a more suspenseful feel, showing a little bit of what the horror moments of the game will be like, but don't worry, there will be fun moments and intense shootings in the future!</strong><br><br>In the past few weeks, people have started to act in a violent and uncontrolled way, doctors don't know how to explain what is happening and not even what to do to solve it. So. To save innocents lifes, people were hired to eliminate possible threats before it's too late.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/1ddb2cc08195f416fe16e627c929628d.poster.avif?t=1657754641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/1ddb2cc08195f416fe16e627c929628d.webm?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/1ddb2cc08195f416fe16e627c929628d.mp4?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You (and your friends) were hired to &quot;wipe&quot; the isolated places where such threats exist. You must find all the infected present in the area and exterminate them with your weapons, but, unfortunately, it will not be that simple, puzzles and scares will be the main obstacles in these searches.<br><br>This game will feature different maps, all divided into parts for better gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/20495274be7ac82e1dbacd8f34a3896a.poster.avif?t=1657754641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/20495274be7ac82e1dbacd8f34a3896a.webm?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/20495274be7ac82e1dbacd8f34a3896a.mp4?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Singleplayer / Campaign Mode<br></li><li> Online Coop With Friends / Campaign Mode (best mode)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/2a824c32ea45424b7db8d036b3e398d1.poster.avif?t=1657754641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/2a824c32ea45424b7db8d036b3e398d1.webm?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/2a824c32ea45424b7db8d036b3e398d1.mp4?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Both modes consist of: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find keys (sometimes..);<br></li><li> Find the infected (before they find you);<br></li><li> Solve puzzles (to find the keys... or not too);<br></li><li> Kill the infected;<br></li><li> <span class=\"bb_strike\"> Scare friends </span><br></li><li> Get scared;<br></li><li> Aaaand, the most importantly, <span class=\"bb_strike\"> break lamps </span> have fun.[/]</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>DEMO IS OUT NOW!! Attention, the Demo is Singleplayer, but the final game is still planned to be Online Coop!</strong><br><br><strong>This DEMO has a more suspenseful feel, showing a little bit of what the horror moments of the game will be like, but don't worry, there will be fun moments and intense shootings in the future!</strong><br><br>In the past few weeks, people have started to act in a violent and uncontrolled way, doctors don't know how to explain what is happening and not even what to do to solve it. So. To save innocents lifes, people were hired to eliminate possible threats before it's too late.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/1ddb2cc08195f416fe16e627c929628d.poster.avif?t=1657754641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/1ddb2cc08195f416fe16e627c929628d.webm?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/1ddb2cc08195f416fe16e627c929628d.mp4?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You (and your friends) were hired to &quot;wipe&quot; the isolated places where such threats exist. You must find all the infected present in the area and exterminate them with your weapons, but, unfortunately, it will not be that simple, puzzles and scares will be the main obstacles in these searches.<br><br>This game will feature different maps, all divided into parts for better gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/20495274be7ac82e1dbacd8f34a3896a.poster.avif?t=1657754641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/20495274be7ac82e1dbacd8f34a3896a.webm?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/20495274be7ac82e1dbacd8f34a3896a.mp4?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Singleplayer / Campaign Mode<br></li><li> Online Coop With Friends / Campaign Mode (best mode)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/2a824c32ea45424b7db8d036b3e398d1.poster.avif?t=1657754641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/2a824c32ea45424b7db8d036b3e398d1.webm?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1406670/extras/2a824c32ea45424b7db8d036b3e398d1.mp4?t=1657754641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Both modes consist of: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find keys (sometimes..);<br></li><li> Find the infected (before they find you);<br></li><li> Solve puzzles (to find the keys... or not too);<br></li><li> Kill the infected;<br></li><li> <span class=\"bb_strike\"> Scare friends </span><br></li><li> Get scared;<br></li><li> Aaaand, the most importantly, <span class=\"bb_strike\"> break lamps </span> have fun.[/]</li></ul>",
